      "description": "<p data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"753\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"753\">Al Wilson – Show and Tell / Listen to Me</strong><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"974\">Original 1973 Rocky Road Records 45 RPM single featuring Al Wilson's No. 1 hit <strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"854\">\"Show and Tell,\"</strong> backed with <strong data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"886\">\"Listen to Me.\"</strong> A classic soul record and a great addition for collectors of 1970s R&amp;B and vintage 45s.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qfm5q2\" data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"986\">Tracks</h3>\n<p data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"998\"><strong data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"998\">Side A</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1021\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1fbpwer\" data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1021\">\nShow and Tell (3:28)\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1033\"><strong data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1033\">Side B</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1055\">\n<li data-section-id=\"l1izrt\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1055\">\nListen to Me (3:12)\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1116\"><strong data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1067\">Label:</strong> Rocky Road Records (Distributed by Bell Records)</p>\n<p data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1138\"><strong data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1132\">Catalog #:</strong> 30073</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1143\">\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hrykuu\" data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1157\">Condition</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1191\"><strong data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1169\">Vinyl:</strong> VG+ (Visually Graded)</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1302\">\n<li data-section-id=\"111bpqw\" data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1216\">\nNice gloss throughout\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jrjfoj\" data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1254\">\nLight surface marks from normal use\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1yn40y9\" data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1302\">\nNo cracks, chips, or major scratches observed\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1315\"><strong data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1315\">Labels:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1381\">\n<li data-section-id=\"do0pkw\" data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1351\">\nOriginal orange Rocky Road labels\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8sd8nk\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1381\">\nLight age and handling wear\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1394\"><strong data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1394\">Sleeve:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1448\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1f3m112\" data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1448\">\nGeneric white paper sleeve (unless otherwise shown)\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1563\">Record has been visually inspected. Please review all photos carefully, as they are part of the item description.</p>",
